  "reason": "The existing evidence shows that multimodal singleprofile models with pca_n2000 and resnet50 achieve ~0.526 accuracy. The uncertainty lies in whether multiprofile settings or aggregation methods improve performance. This experiment tests multiprofile with avgpool aggregation (a key design choice) while keeping fusion as concat, isolating the effect of profile setting and aggregation. It balances exploration of multiprofile (which may capture more data patterns) and exploitation of proven components (resnet50, concat fusion)."
}

